{# First screenful of posts. Its height is reserved before the feed answers
   (.live-feed-first), so the lead form below starts under the fold and
   nothing on screen moves as cards land. The status line holds the stats
   ("14 photos this week · 5 towns", from the feed only) or, with no posts,
   what happened — and the same reserved space holds the welcome panel, so a
   page with zero posts still reads as intentional, with the form right below. #}
<section class="live-feed-section live-feed-first">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="live-status" id="live-status" role="status" aria-live="polite">Loading the latest jobs…</p>
